Field\", \"Msb\", \"Lsb\", \"SWaccess\", \"HWaccess\", \"Default\", \"Description\"], \"n_rows\": 7, \"n_cols\": 9, \"quality_flags\": [\"no_caption\", \"has_merged_cells\"]}}}, {\"id\": \"arm::protocol::PCIE Subsystem Spec_v3.21#c_section_s4.4_75\", \"kind\": \"section\", \"doc_id\": \"arm::protocol::PCIE Subsystem Spec_v3.21\", \"page\": 21, \"page_start\": 21, \"page_end\": 21, \"section_id\": \"4.4\", \"section_node_id\": \"arm::sec:4.4#arm::protocol::PCIE Subsystem Spec_v3.21\", \"text\": \"4.4 Clock\", \"block_ids\": [\"arm::protocol::PCIE Subsystem Spec_v3.21#p21#b2\"], \"attrs\": {\"section_path\": \"4.4\", \"section_node_id\": \"arm::sec:4.4#arm::protocol::PCIE Subsystem Spec_v3.21\", \"page_start\": 21, \"page_end\": 21, \"chunk_type\": \"section\"}}, {\"id\": \"arm::doc::DDI0275(Arm Cortex-M4 处理器数据表)#c_section_s2.10.1_94\", \"kind\": \"section\", \"doc_id\": \"arm::doc::DDI0275(Arm Cortex-M4 处理器数据表)\", \"page\": 37, \"page_start\": 37, \"page_end\": 37, \"section_id\": \"2.10.1\", \"section_node_id\": \"arm::sec:2.10.1#arm::doc::DDI0275(Arm Cortex-M4 处理器数据表)\", \"text\": \"2.10.1 Clocks\", \"block_ids\": [\"arm::doc::DDI0275(Arm Cortex-M4 处理器数据表)#p37#b17\"], \"attrs\": {\"section_path\": \"2.10.1\", \"section_node_id\": \"arm::sec:2.10.1#arm::doc::DDI0275(Arm Cortex-M4 处理器数据表)\", \"page_start\": 37, \"page_end\": 37, \"chunk_type\": \"section\"}}, {\"id\": \"arm::doc::DDI0275(Arm Cortex-M4 处理器数据表)#c_section_s2.10_92\", \"kind\": \"section\", \"doc_id\": \"arm::doc::DDI0275(Arm Cortex-M4 处理器数据表)\", \"page\": 37, \"page_start\": 37, \"page_end\": 37, \"section_id\": \"2.10\", \"section_node_id\": \"arm::sec:2.10#arm::doc::DDI0275(Arm Cortex-M4 处理器数据表)\", \"text\": \"2.10 Clocks, and resets\\nThis section describes:\\nClocks\\nResets .\\nThe ETB11 has three clock domains:\\nTAP controller, clocked by DBGTCK\\nmemory-mapped peripheral, clocked by HCLK\\nremainder of the system including ETB11 registers, clocked by CLK .\\nDBGTCK is synchronous to CLK when used with ETM11RV. Synchronization issues can therefore be ignored and are not discussed further. See ETM versions and variants on page 1-5 for details of other ETB products,\\nHCLK can be synchronous or asynchronous to CLK depending on your system design. Synchronization logic is provided for asynchronous designs. Register read and write accesses, and RAM read and write accesses, using the AHB interface are described in:\\nRead transfer on page 2-19\\nWrite transfer on page 2-22.\\nThere are the following resets:\\nnRESET resets all of the ETB11 registers in the CLK domain. nRESET must be synchronized to CLK using the circuit shown in Figure 2-7.\\nnDBGTRST is the TAP controller reset signal used to reset the ETB11 TAP controller and other DBGTCK domain registers. nDBGTRST must be synchronized to CLK using the circuit shown in Figure 2-7.\", \"block_ids\": [\"arm::doc::DDI0275(Arm Cortex-M4 处理器数据表)#p37#b1\", \"arm::doc::DDI0275(Arm Cortex-M4 处理器数据表)#p37#b2\", \"arm::doc::DDI0275(Arm Cortex-M4 处理器数据表)#p37#b3\", \"arm::doc::DDI0275(Arm Cortex-M4 处理器数据表)#p37#b4\", \"arm::doc::DDI0275(Arm Cortex-M4 处理器数据表)#p37#b5\", \"arm::doc::DDI0275(Arm Cortex-M4 处理器数据表)#p37#b6\", \"arm::doc::DDI0275(Arm Cortex-M4 处理器数据表)#p37#b7\", \"arm::doc::DDI0275(Arm Cortex-M4 处理器数据表)#p37#b8\", \"arm::doc::DDI0275(Arm Cortex-M4 处理器数据表)#p37#b9\", \"arm::doc::DDI0275(Arm Cortex-M4 处理器数据表)#p37#b10\", \"arm::doc::DDI0275(Arm Cortex-M4 处理器数据表)#p37#b11\", \"arm::doc::DDI0275(Arm Cortex-M4 处理器数据表)#p37#b12\", \"arm::doc::DDI0275(Arm Cortex-M4 处理器数据表)#p37#b13\", \"arm::doc::DDI0275(Arm Cortex-M4 处理器数据表)#p37#b14\", \"arm::doc::DDI0275(Arm Cortex-M4 处理器数据表)#p37#b15\"], \"attrs\": {\"section_path\": \"2.10\", \"section_node_id\": \"arm::sec:2.10#arm::doc::DDI0275(Arm Cortex-M4 处理器数据表)\", \"page_start\": 37, \"page_end\": 37, \"chunk_type\": \"section\"}}], \"coverage_warning\": [\"Clock entity coverage appears limited; verify clock facts against L1/L0 chunks and source figures/tables.\"], \"limits\": {\"max_s